# 3. High-Level Architecture

The application follows a three-layer architecture:

1. Presentation Layer — React frontend.
2. Application Layer — Node.js and Express backend.
3. Data Layer — MongoDB database and Cloudinary storage.

```text
                  CLIENT
                    |
                    v
             React Application
                    |
                    v
              React Router
                    |
                    v
               Axios Client
                    |
              HTTPS Requests
                    |
                    v
             Express Server
                    |
          -----------------------
          |          |          |
          v          v          v
      Middleware  Controllers  Routes
          |          |
          |          v
          |        Services
          |          |
          ---------- |
                     v
               Mongoose Models
                     |
                     v
                 MongoDB

External Services:
    |---- Cloudinary
    |---- Email Provider
```

